# UI fonts are tracked on purpose. The Workshop bundle must embed a Thai-capable family, and a clone
# that cannot re-export with the real font ships English-only UI without any visible error.
# Only OFL-licensed files belong here (see Fonts/README.md); never add a font without
# redistribution rights to this directory.

